# =============================================================================
# P2P Procurement — Backend environment templates
#
# Setup once:
#   npm run env:init          # copies .env.dev.example → .env.dev, etc.
#   edit .env.dev with your sandbox keys
#
# Run:
#   npm run dev               # uses .env.dev  (sandbox / local)
#   npm run dev:prod          # uses .env.prod (prod config, dev server)
#   npm run build:prod        # build with .env.prod
#   npm run start:prod        # run production build
#   npm run env:check         # validate .env.dev
#   npm run env:check:prod    # validate .env.prod
# =============================================================================

See `.env.dev.example` and `.env.prod.example` for full variable lists.
